      "en": "He said to me: “Son of man, this is the place of my throne[NOTE:1] and the place for the soles of my feet,[NOTE:2] where I will live among the people of Israel forever. The house of Israel will no longer profane my holy name, neither they nor their kings, by their spiritual prostitution or by the pillars of their kings set up when they die.[NOTE:3]",
